RESOLUTION FRAME
  both can be true at once:
    demo looks incremental
    commercial middle already compounding
      (mapped interstate + back office + first-pass cognition)

SHOCK FUNCTION
  shock ~= dA/dt  -  dS/dt
  high when miles/tasks move faster than awareness

  rough times if
    T_mid rises across many sectors in same window
    D does not rebuild at same wage/place
    L falls faster than prices recycle into demand

NOT REQUIRED FOR SHOCK
  100% job wipe
  humanoid general robots
  nationwide winter ODD
  every last-mile stop unmanned
